<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 3.1 percent in the week ended September 27, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 3.1 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages declined 4.5 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 3.1 percent to 271.4 from 263.3 the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 4.2 percent to 184.3 in the latest survey from 192.4 in the previous week, it said.  </p>
